# DS5008: `render` on the right side of `join`.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| join (from t | summarize total = sum(revenue) by customerId | render barchart) on customerId
---- expected
error[DS5008]: `render` must end a query statement
  --> query:2:65
  |
2 | | join (from t | summarize total = sum(revenue) by customerId | render barchart) on customerId
  |                                                                 ^^^^^^ this `render` is on the right side of `join`
  |
  = help: move the `render` to the end of the query statement that shows this table
  = note: only a query statement's result is shown, so a chart anywhere else could never be drawn
